# Local review databases. The review itself is portable: `harmscope-bench export` writes the
# committed snapshot the web app renders, so no working database belongs in the repository.
.data/
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm

# `apps/web/content/case.json` is deliberately NOT ignored: it is the review artefact, and its
# diff is the diff of the review.
